{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fuel efficiency unit conversion fuel efficiency unit conversion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","fileName":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Reciprocal Conversion Factors","Compound Rate Unit Conversion","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fuel efficiency unit conversion fuel efficiency unit conversion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","fileName":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion","heading":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The book's fuel-efficiency quantities are distance per fuel volume: mi/gal and km/L. Converting mi/gal to km/L multiplies by kilometers per mile and by gallons per liter, the latter being the reciprocal orientation of a liters-per-gallon factor. Miles and gallons cancel separately. This is a compound ratio conversion, not merely a conversion of miles; both parts of the measure must preserve their positions. See [[Reciprocal Conversion Factors]] and [[Compound Rate Unit Conversion]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Reciprocal Conversion Factors","Compound Rate Unit Conversion","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fuel efficiency unit conversion fuel efficiency unit conversion","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","fileName":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fuel Efficiency Unit Conversion","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Reciprocal Conversion Factors","Compound Rate Unit Conversion","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}